    <section>
        <h2>Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            Welcome to <strong>Quick Units</strong>, developed by <strong>Qayham</strong>. This app provides a variety of unit conversion tools, 
            including time, speed, weight, fuel, frequency, BMI, BMR, age, and a world clock. Your privacy is important to us, and we are committed to protecting it.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Data Collection and Usage</h2>
        <p>
            We do not collect, store, or process any personal data in any form. The app operates entirely on your device and does not require any user data to function.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Ads Display</h2>
        <p>
            To support the development and maintenance of <strong>Quick Units</strong>, we display advertisements within the app. These ads may be provided by 
            third-party ad networks, which may collect certain data as described in their privacy policies. Please review the privacy policies of the respective 
            ad providers for more information.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
            While we do not collect data, the third-party ad networks integrated into the app may collect limited information to serve ads. 
            This may include device identifiers, IP address, and usage statistics. We recommend reviewing the privacy policies of these third parties for further details.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Your Consent</h2>
        <p>
            By using <strong>Quick Units</strong>, you agree to this privacy policy and understand that ads may be displayed within the app.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
            We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected here with the updated effective date.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
